  "nodes": [
    {
      "post_id": "499705041238765568",
      "text": "The law enforcement show of force in #Ferguson is more heavily-armed than some of my patrols were in active war zones. \n\nThink about that.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:52:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499707860087885824",
      "text": "@ABakerN7 That was standard in a lot of ways for our gear in the USMC; hand-me-downs that we depended on maintaining however we could.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 00:03:32 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997073702816604e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499711229460377601",
      "text": "@ABakerN7 We had to rig an antenna solution using an MRE spoon as inline resistor. Ah, field-expedient troubleshooting.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 00:16:55 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.99710826279084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499742928764280832",
      "text": "@NBomb The country &amp; ideals I swore to defend are better than this.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 02:22:53 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9974206233892045e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499706424146935808",
      "text": "@MagusXIX @BelgianBoolean Agreed regarding the lack of discipline; maintaining the respect of people you're charged to protect is part too.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:57:50 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9970590115076506e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499742062338920448",
      "text": "@sa_roux Yeah… I keep thinking that isn’t the America I looked up to (maybe naively) when I was little. A small part of me feels that loss.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 02:19:27 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997417163507917e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499706556049416193",
      "text": "@sa_roux @BelgianBoolean They can start earning that respect back by ceasing to pretend that they aren't civilians.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:58:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997064241469358e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499712333418364929",
      "text": "@sa_roux BAHAHA! That's awesome. I miss those days, and I don't.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 00:21:19 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997112294603776e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499708183804661760",
      "text": "@sa_roux I remember Americans and everyone else called us CANT BAT 1 &amp; 2 rather than CANBAT 1 &amp; 2 because we can't do anything.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 00:04:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997078600878858e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499705508358389764",
      "text": "@sa_roux It's super super scary and just wrong",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:54:11 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997050412387656e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499741716350791682",
      "text": "@NBomb It would be terrible anywhere, but that the country self-styled as Paragon of Freedom has this happening is indescribably horrible.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 02:18:04 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9973925393780326e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499710826279084033",
      "text": "@sa_roux I once had to climb a tree running copper wire to enhance the range of the 10ft whip on that radio. Oh those were the days.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 00:15:19 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9970999530736845e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499708611925250048",
      "text": "@ABakerN7 That's crappy. We often made it work however we could - sometimes sharing - especially in joint-ops with other countries.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 00:06:31 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9970818380466176e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499705731780579328",
      "text": "@tasmen I cannot even begin to articulate how much this situation saddens and sickens me.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:55:05 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.9970550835838976e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499706641923973120",
      "text": "@sa_roux @ruckawriter Because its only constitution to protest if its a fallen war hero.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:58:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997050412387656e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499739253937803265",
      "text": "@sa_roux Even as a foreigner, I’m a little sad about what I’m seeing in #Ferguson. I mean that sincerely. I hope this doesn’t turn worse.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Aug 14 02:08:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997050412387656e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499705901150765058",
      "text": "@sa_roux @BelgianBoolean It's not the amount of firepower that worries me. It's the lack of discipline. They're a disgrace.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Aug 13 23:55:45 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 4.997050412387656e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "499737275811762177",
      "text": "@sa_roux @ritzyfoxx You and me both. We went in lighter in most areas.",
